<main data-writer-document>
<h1 id="notes-across-notebook-cells">Notes across notebook cells</h1>
<p>First<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-1" href="#fn-1" role="doc-noteref">1</a></sup>, shared<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-2" href="#fn-2" role="doc-noteref">2</a></sup>, image<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-3" href="#fn-3" role="doc-noteref">3</a></sup>, attachment<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-4" href="#fn-4" role="doc-noteref">4</a></sup>, and <sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-5" href="#fn-5" role="doc-noteref">5</a></sup>. See <a class="ref" href="#fig-later">Figure 3</a>.</p>
<p>Again<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-2-2" href="#fn-2" role="doc-noteref">2</a></sup>, image again<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-3-2" href="#fn-3" role="doc-noteref">3</a></sup>, and <sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-6" href="#fn-6" role="doc-noteref">6</a></sup>.</p>
<p>Case reference<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-7" href="#fn-7" role="doc-noteref">7</a></sup>.</p>
<p>Case again<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-7-2" href="#fn-7" role="doc-noteref">7</a></sup>.</p>
<p>Undefined[^undefined].</p>
<p>Before open fence[^shared].</p>
<pre class="hl-code"><code class="language-python"><span class="line"><span class="hl-source hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-variable hl-function hl-python"><span class="hl-support hl-function hl-builtin hl-python">print</span></span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python">(</span><span class="hl-meta hl-string hl-python"><span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-begin hl-python">&quot;</span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-string hl-python"><span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-python">unchanged<span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-end hl-python">&quot;</span></span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python">)</span></span></span></span></code></pre>
<aside class="callout callout-note" role="note">
<p class="callout-title">Note</p>
<p>A reference in an open note[^shared].</p>
</aside>
<aside class="callout callout-note" role="note">
<p class="callout-title">Note</p>
<p>A reference before an open fence[^shared].</p>
<pre class="hl-code"><code class="language-python"><span class="line"><span class="hl-source hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-variable hl-function hl-python"><span class="hl-support hl-function hl-builtin hl-python">print</span></span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python">(</span><span class="hl-meta hl-string hl-python"><span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-begin hl-python">&quot;</span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-string hl-python"><span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-python">still unchanged<span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-end hl-python">&quot;</span></span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python">)</span></span></span></span></code></pre>
</aside>
<hr>
<hr>
<p>Later reference<sup class="footnote-ref"><a id="fnref-8" href="#fn-8" role="doc-noteref">8</a></sup>.</p>
<div class="cell" data-cell="11">
<div class="cell-input">
<div class="cell-prompt">In [1]:</div>
<pre class="hl-code"><code class="language-python"><span class="line"><span class="hl-source hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-variable hl-function hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python">display</span></span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python">(</span><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-qualified-name hl-python"><span class="hl-variable hl-function hl-python"><span class="hl-meta hl-generic-name hl-python">Markdown</span></span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-function-call hl-arguments hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-begin hl-python">(</span><span class="hl-meta hl-string hl-python"><span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-python"><span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-begin hl-python">&quot;</span></span></span><span class="hl-meta hl-string hl-python"><span class="hl-string hl-quoted hl-double hl-python">output note<span class="hl-punctuation hl-definition hl-string hl-end hl-python">&quot;</span></span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python">)</span></span><span class="hl-punctuation hl-section hl-arguments hl-end hl-python">)</span></span></span></span></code></pre>
</div>
